{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure, no complex rules and menus, just beautifully simple gameplay you can learn in less than 30 seconds. Despite this simplicity, the core mechanics allows for a wide range of strategies and optimizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up from only a single block and create an idyllic sprawling landscape. Use the cards in your hand to strategically place farms, houses, and rivers to optimize synergies to gain points. Gain enough points, and you get more cards. If not, your town comes to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/extras/545f4afa28772e40dac8391e1bb13f5c.poster.avif?t=1769154919\" width=448 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/extras/545f4afa28772e40dac8391e1bb13f5c.webm?t=1769154919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/extras/545f4afa28772e40dac8391e1bb13f5c.mp4?t=1769154919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the pieces become weirder and wackier, challenging you to think up new strategies and build in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/extras/4edd821867a804bfd58fff73db07ecbd.poster.avif?t=1769154919\" width=448 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/extras/4edd821867a804bfd58fff73db07ecbd.webm?t=1769154919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/extras/4edd821867a804bfd58fff73db07ecbd.mp4?t=1769154919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you chain together satisfying synergies, take a step back and watch your beautiful creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/extras/1117826be1abcf4b31df39cd4df43ae6.poster.avif?t=1769154919\" width=448 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/extras/1117826be1abcf4b31df39cd4df43ae6.webm?t=1769154919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/extras/1117826be1abcf4b31df39cd4df43ae6.mp4?t=1769154919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034080?t=1769154919","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034080?t=1769154919","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/b5e84c3149ff8cd12f73b7bd77f75468cec34c1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769154919","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034080/b5e84c3149ff8cd12f73b7bd77f75468cec34c1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769154919","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure, no complex rules and menus, just beautifully simple gameplay you can learn in less than 30 seconds. Despite this simplicity, the core mechanics allows for a wide range of strategies and optimizations.</p><p